        "Finite fixture score tolerance plus exact greedy action agreement is not universal bitwise equivalence; unseen near-ties remain possible.",
        "Local Node host memory/timing measurements are not BGS 512 MiB/1 CPU/concurrency/cold-import acceptance tests.",
